{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo offers around <strong>1 hour of gameplay</strong>, designed to give you a first taste of Project Obscure\u2019s steampunk atmosphere. Explore the depths of a mysterious facility, solve <strong>over 10 physics-based puzzles</strong>, manipulate light to control objects, and uncover the first hints of the facility\u2019s dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is intended to showcase the game\u2019s core mechanics and atmosphere. It includes only a selection of chapters and puzzles, while additional content, full story progression, and technical improvements will be available in the full version. Since development is still ongoing, this demo may contain <strong>visual, audio, or save-related bugs</strong>. Please note that <strong>saves made in the demo will not carry over to the full game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the official <strong>demo</strong> version of <strong>Project OBSCURE</strong>, and it <strong>may not fully reflect the final quality of the game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project OBSCURE</strong> is a physics-based first-person puzzle game where you manipulate objects using the power of light. <br> <br>Command objects using the power of &quot;Light&quot; and explore the forgotten chambers of an old facility. Harness the Law of Inertia\u2014the first law of motion\u2014and manipulate objects with the help of your flashlight. We aim to bring a fresh perspective to the puzzle genre, a mixture of both lively and realistic mechanics.   <br> <br>As you progress, uncover secrets and prepare yourself for mind-boggling puzzles. Prepare yourself for an atmospheric steampunk experience. May the light guide you... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcf0 CUTTING EDGE TECHNOLOGIES FROM QUARK CORP!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>S-8 GRAVITON</strong> is a groundbreaking invention from <strong>QUARK CORP</strong>. It enlarges when exposed to light and shrinks back to its original size when the lights turn off. SIZE SOMETIMES MATTERS!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026880/extras/858918efa54e79836ac8def70552b82d.poster.avif?t=1758257864\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026880/extras/858918efa54e79836ac8def70552b82d.webm?t=1758257864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026880/extras/858918efa54e79836ac8def70552b82d.mp4?t=1758257864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>While our beloved <strong>S-8 GRAVITON</strong> changes its size, its weight also changes accordingly. But keep in mind \u2014 EXCESS OF ANYTHING IS BAD.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026880/extras/807925f3035db468912accd71d0571ad.poster.avif?t=1758257864\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026880/extras/807925f3035db468912accd71d0571ad.webm?t=1758257864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026880/extras/807925f3035db468912accd71d0571ad.mp4?t=1758257864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The <strong>S-8 GRAVITON</strong> is now levitating \u2014 thanks to our cutting-edge technology, the &quot;<strong>F-0 FLUX</strong>&quot; NOT YOUR USUAL FLASHLIGHT.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026880/extras/8c3b7b3742ae2af6e39b6d4bd9db4073.poster.avif?t=1758257864\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026880/extras/8c3b7b3742ae2af6e39b6d4bd9db4073.webm?t=1758257864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026880/extras/8c3b7b3742ae2af6e39b6d4bd9db4073.mp4?t=1758257864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But sometimes, it becomes just an ordinary flashlight, helping you open gates. Here at <strong>QUARK CORP</strong>, everything is high-tech \u2014 SO YOU WON'T NEED TO SEARCH FOR THE KEYS.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026880/extras/f2b34bd58f5c67080dff44249def2cc6.poster.avif?t=1758257864\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026880/extras/f2b34bd58f5c67080dff44249def2cc6.webm?t=1758257864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026880/extras/f2b34bd58f5c67080dff44249def2cc6.mp4?t=1758257864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>L-3 PHOTON</strong></i> is just an ordinary sidekick of <i><strong>S-8 GRAVITON</strong></i> . It absorbs light and emits it. WHAT A COPYCAT!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026880/extras/6e08b9f68fc888caf83adfcee184fdc4.poster.avif?t=1758257864\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026880/extras/6e08b9f68fc888caf83adfcee184fdc4.webm?t=1758257864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026880/extras/6e08b9f68fc888caf83adfcee184fdc4.mp4?t=1758257864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026880?t=1758257864","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026880?t=1758257864","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026880/9f577bc0457f2d4555ca1715e35c3af1328f8a95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758257864","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026880/9f577bc0457f2d4555ca1715e35c3af1328f8a95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758257864","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo